  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Stock cultures of leptospirae were mainitained in a basal medium containing 10% pooled rabbit serum, 0.02 M Na2HPO4-KH2PO4 buffer at pH 7.4  (Johnson and Wilson, 1960), 10-3 M NH4CI, and 5 μg/ml of thiamine (Johnson and Gary, 1963). Cultures were incubated at 30 C and transferred every 7days."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
